# Untitled

Micro or nano: Evaluation of biosafety and biopotency of magnesium metal organic framework-74 with different particle sizes
Zhou Zhu1,§, Shaokang Jiang1,§, Yanhua Liu1,§, Xiaomeng Gao1, Shanshan Hu1, Xin Zhang1, Chao Huang2, Qianbing Wan1, Jian Wang1 (✉), and Xibo Pei1 (✉)
